# Wave W17-X (Route 210): ranch sand — ranch-road pale sand, design-authorised: a warm pale sand running Repose to the Shardfall fork under the paddock fences, the warmest path in the tranche (design: the ranch road north, farmstead at its foot). Split from Route 209’s cool bell sand by the warmth entire and from Route 215’s puddle sand ahead by dryness: this road is dusty, that one is rained on.
